<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Optional practice support</title><base href="/api/v1/course-tests/chinese-2/c/file/"><link rel="stylesheet" href="paper.css"></head><body><main><header class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">HSKKit · Chinese 2 Course Review · Original Paper C</p><h1>Optional practice support</h1><p>40 listening/reading questions + 4 writing/speaking tasks. Independent course-review draft.</p><p class="note">Printable materials and answer references. Open the workspace for section clocks and local recording. Writing and speaking need self-review or review by your own teacher.</p><nav class="links"><a href="index.html">Overview</a><a href="student.html">Learner paper</a><a href="teacher.html">Answers &amp; scripts</a><a href="listening.html">Listen to Paper C</a><a href="student.pdf">Learner PDF</a><a href="student-traditional.pdf">繁體 PDF</a><a href="teacher.pdf">Answer PDF</a></nav></header><section class="box"><p>This optional preparation list is not part of the timed paper. Using it during an attempt changes the support condition.</p><table><tr><th>Chinese</th><th>Pinyin</th><th>Meaning</th></tr><tr><td class="cn">客房</td><td>kèfáng</td><td>guest room</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">行李</td><td>xíngli</td><td>luggage</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">绕路</td><td>rào lù</td><td>take a detour</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">地下通道</td><td>dìxià tōngdào</td><td>underpass</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">交通卡</td><td>jiāotōngkǎ</td><td>transport card</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">礼盒</td><td>lǐhé</td><td>gift box</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">把手</td><td>bǎshou</td><td>handle</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">围巾</td><td>wéijīn</td><td>scarf</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">摆好</td><td>bǎi hǎo</td><td>set out neatly</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">饮用水</td><td>yǐnyòngshuǐ</td><td>drinking water</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">摊位</td><td>tānwèi</td><td>market stall</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">运费</td><td>yùnfèi</td><td>delivery charge</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">信封</td><td>xìnfēng</td><td>envelope</td></tr><tr><td class="cn">团聚</td><td>tuánjù</td><td>reunion</td></tr></table></section></main></body></html>